aecProjectDiscordNoteDesc,items,Item,,[FFFFFF]Join the AEC PROJECT Discord for any mod question or request.[-],Tritt dem AEC PROJECT Discord fuer jede Mod Frage oder Anfrage bei.,Unete al Discord de AEC PROJECT para cualquier pregunta o solicitud sobre mods.,Rejoignez le Discord AEC PROJECT pour toute question ou demande sur les mods.,Unisciti al Discord AEC PROJECT per qualsiasi domanda o richiesta sui mod.,MOD ni kansuru shitsumon ya irai wa AEC PROJECT Discord ni sanka shite kudasai.,mod gwanryeon munui na yocheongeun AEC PROJECT Discorde chamgahae juseyo.,Dolacz do Discorda AEC PROJECT w sprawie kazdego pytania lub prosby o mody.,Entre no Discord AEC PROJECT para qualquer duvida ou pedido sobre mods.,"[FFFFFF]Присоединяйтесь к Discord-серверу проекта [FFD700]AEC[-][FFFFFF], чтобы задать вопрос или оставить предложение.[-][-]",Mod sorusu veya istegi icin AEC PROJECT Discord sunucusuna katilin.,Ru you youguan mod de wenti huo qingqiu qing jiaru AEC PROJECT Discord.,Ru you youguan mod de wenti huo qingqiu qing jiaru AEC PROJECT Discord.
